<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3 John</book>
  <para style="h">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc1">3 John</para>
  <para style="toc2">3 John</para>
  <para style="mt">3 John</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upa chuan, Duh tak Gaia, tihtak zeta ka hmangaiha hnênah chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Duh tak, i thlarau chuan malsâwmna a hmuh angin, engkimah malsâwmna i hmuh leh i dam theih nân ka ṭawngṭai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Unaute lo kalin i takzia (thutaka i awm ṭhinzia chu) mi rawn hriattîr lai khân ka lawm êm êm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka fate thutakah an awm tih ka hriat aliama lâwmna nasa zâwk rêng ka nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Duh tak, unaute chu mikhual ni mah sela, an chunga i tih apiangah rinawm takin i ti ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />chûng mite chuan kohhran hmaah i hmangaihna an hriattîr tawh; anni chu an zinnaah chuan Pathian mi ni âwm rênga i puihbawm chuan a ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hming avâng hian Jentail-te hnên ata eng mah la lovin an lo thawk chhuak si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, thutak thawhpuitute kan nih theih nân chutiang mi chu keinin kan lâwm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kohhran hnênah khân thu tlêm chu ka ziak tawh; nimahsela, Diotrepha, an zînga chungnun duh ṭhîn khân mi lâwm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka lo kal chuan a thiltihte ka hriat chhuahtîr leh ang, kan chungah thu sual sawiin a kamtamzia hi; chu pawh chu tâwk a ti lo va, amah ngeiin unaute a lâwm lo va, a lâwm duhte pawh a khap a, kohhran zîng ata a hnawt chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Duh tak, sual chu zir suh la, ṭha chu zir zâwk ang che. Thil ṭha titu chu Pathian laka mi a ni; thil sual titu chuan Pathian a hmu ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Demetria chuan mi zawng zawng fak a hlawh a, thutaka fak ngei a hlawh bawk a; a ni, keini pawhin kan fak a ni; kan fakna hi a dik a ni tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I hnênah thu tam tak ziak tûr ka nei a; nimahsela, lehkhatui leh lehkhaziaknain i hnêna ziak ka duh lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rei lo tê chinah hmuh che ka beisei zâwk a; tichuan, inhmatawnin kan inbia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlamuanna i chungah awm rawh se. Kan ṭhianten chibai an bûk a che. An hming lam ṭheuhvin ṭhiante chu chibai mi bûksak ang che.
  </para>
</usx>
